# pstack for Kasboek

Install: `/add-plugin pstack` then `/setup-pstack`.

Default entry: **`/poteto-mode`** for any non-trivial task.

## Priority skills for this app

| Skill / playbook | When |
|---|---|
| `/poteto-mode` + **feature** | New API endpoints, UI flows (inbox, ledger, envelopes) |
| `/poteto-mode` + **bug fix** | Wrong category, balance math, import dupes — repro first |
| `/create-verification-skill` | After the app boots reliably; generate live verify harness |
| `/tdd` | Money/cents, categorization rules, import dedupe |
| `/how` / `/why` | Before editing categorize, store, or import paths |
| `/architect` + `/arena` | Choosing OCR/PDF vs vision, or schema changes |
| `/swarm` | Parallel verify of inbox + ledger + envelopes |
| `/unslop` / `/no-comments` | Keep Go/React lean |
| `/blast-radius` | Budget/amount changes that affect month totals |
| `/babysit` + **opening a pr** | Drive PRs to merge-ready |
| **visual parity** playbook | Matching Kasboek v2 design prototype |
| **autonomous run** | Overnight import/categorize improvements |

## Project invariants agents must keep

- Local only: no cloud deploy, no production build required.
- Money stored as **integer cents** in Postgres; display as EUR nl-NL.
- Categorize: **rules first**, Ollama only for unmatched descriptions.
- Postgres for this app is on **port 5433** (compose). Do not hijack :5432.
- Dutch UI copy unless asked otherwise.
